Typing-habit benchmark (data/benchmark/)

Generated from the Mongolian word list data/wordlist/mn.txt, which is derived
from Mongolian Wikipedia (dump mnwiki-20261101). Attribution: Mongolian
Wikipedia contributors. Changes: the words are turned into Latin spellings
with synthetic typing habits, and a sample is kept.

